{"title":"Career Roadmap: Insurance Advisor","role":"Insurance Advisor","summary":"An Insurance Advisor helps individuals and businesses identify financial protection needs and select appropriate insurance products such as life, health, motor, property and business insurance. The role combines insurance knowledge, financial planning awareness, customer relationship management, sales, compliance and communication.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com - Banking & Insurance"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build insurance, financial-product, customer advisory, sales and regulatory knowledge"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Insurance Advisor helps individuals and businesses identify financial protection needs and select appropriate insurance products such as life, health, motor, property and business insurance. The role combines insurance knowledge, financial planning awareness, customer relationship management, sales, compliance and communication."},{"type":"p","text":"The advisor should be able to understand a customer's requirements, explain policy features and exclusions clearly, compare suitable products, assist with documentation and claims processes, and maintain long-term client relationships."},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"In India, selling/soliciting insurance is a regulated activity. Academic qualification alone does not automatically authorize someone to act as an insurance agent/advisor. The person must meet the applicable IRDAI licensing/training/examination and insurer/intermediary requirements for the role they undertake."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Commerce & finance fundamentals"},{"text":"Accounting, economics, business studies"},{"text":"Excel-based financial analysis"},{"text":"Weak financial basics"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Insurance fundamentals"},{"text":"Life, health, general insurance"},{"text":"Insurance product comparison"},{"text":"Memorizing products without understanding"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Advisory & sales skills"},{"text":"Financial planning, customer profiling, regulations"},{"text":"Insurance advisory case studies"},{"text":"Aggressive or unsuitable selling"}],[{"text":"Final Stage"},{"text":"Industry readiness"},{"text":"Licensing preparation, CRM, analytics, internships"},{"text":"Internship + certification/licensing preparation"},{"text":"Lack of regulatory knowledge"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Business Mathematics"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Excel fundamentals"},{"text":"Personal finance basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate Accounting"},{"text":"Banking fundamentals"},{"text":"Financial markets"},{"text":"Business statistics"},{"text":"Customer communication"},{"text":"Presentation skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Principles of Insurance"},{"text":"Risk Management"},{"text":"Life Insurance"},{"text":"General Insurance"},{"text":"Insurance terminology"},{"text":"Insurance contracts and policy structures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Health Insurance"},{"text":"Motor Insurance"},{"text":"Property Insurance"},{"text":"Commercial Insurance"},{"text":"Claims management"},{"text":"Underwriting fundamentals"},{"text":"Insurance regulations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial planning"},{"text":"Customer needs analysis"},{"text":"Insurance product comparison"},{"text":"Sales management"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Digital insurance platforms"},{"text":"Insurance analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advisory case studies"},{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"Regulatory/licensing preparation"},{"text":"Sales pipeline management"},{"text":"Customer retention"},{"text":"Claims assistance"},{"text":"Final insurance advisory project"}]}]},{"heading":"Core Insurance Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Life Insurance"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Term insurance"},{"text":"Whole-life insurance"},{"text":"Endowment policies"},{"text":"Money-back policies"},{"text":"ULIPs"},{"text":"Annuities"},{"text":"Pension products"},{"text":"Riders"},{"text":"Premiums"},{"text":"Sum assured"},{"text":"Policy term"},{"text":"Maturity benefits"},{"text":"Surrender value"},{"text":"Nomination"},{"text":"Policy exclusions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The advisor should understand when a product may or may not be suitable, rather than simply focusing on commission or premium."},{"type":"h","text":"Health Insurance"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Individual health insurance"},{"text":"Family floater policies"},{"text":"Group health insurance"},{"text":"Hospitalization coverage"},{"text":"Waiting periods"},{"text":"Pre-existing diseases"},{"text":"Room-rent limits"},{"text":"Co-payment"},{"text":"Deductibles"},{"text":"Network hospitals"},{"text":"Cashless claims"},{"text":"Reimbursement claims"},{"text":"Exclusions"},{"text":"No-claim benefits"},{"text":"Restoration benefits"}]},{"type":"h","text":"General Insurance"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Motor insurance"},{"text":"Property insurance"},{"text":"Travel insurance"},{"text":"Personal accident insurance"},{"text":"Marine insurance"},{"text":"Commercial insurance"},{"text":"Business interruption concepts"},{"text":"Liability insurance"}]}]},{"heading":"Insurance Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master the relationship between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Risk","Protection Need","Policy","Premium","Coverage","Claim"]},{"type":"p","text":"Important concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Peril"},{"text":"Hazard"},{"text":"Insurable interest"},{"text":"Indemnity"},{"text":"Utmost good faith"},{"text":"Proximate cause"},{"text":"Subrogation"},{"text":"Contribution"},{"text":"Deductibles"},{"text":"Policy exclusions"},{"text":"Sum insured"},{"text":"Sum assured"},{"text":"Premium"},{"text":"Policy tenure"},{"text":"Claim settlement"}]}]},{"heading":"Customer Needs Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong Insurance Advisor should not begin with a product."},{"type":"p","text":"Start with the customer's:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Age"},{"text":"Income"},{"text":"Dependents"},{"text":"Existing insurance"},{"text":"Liabilities"},{"text":"Financial goals"},{"text":"Health considerations"},{"text":"Emergency fund"},{"text":"Risk exposure"},{"text":"Retirement requirements"},{"text":"Business risks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Then determine the protection gap."},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"A customer has:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"₹10 lakh annual income"},{"text":"Home loan"},{"text":"Spouse"},{"text":"Two children"},{"text":"Existing life cover of ₹20 lakh"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The advisor should evaluate whether the existing protection is adequate rather than simply recommending another policy."}]},{"heading":"Financial Planning Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Protection Planning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Life protection"},{"text":"Health protection"},{"text":"Income replacement"},{"text":"Emergency planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Goal Planning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Marriage"},{"text":"Home purchase"},{"text":"Retirement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Basic Financial Mathematics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Simple and compound interest"},{"text":"Inflation"},{"text":"Present value"},{"text":"Future value"},{"text":"SIP concepts"},{"text":"Loan EMI"},{"text":"Real return"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The advisor should understand the difference between insurance as protection and investment products designed primarily for wealth accumulation."}]},{"heading":"Underwriting Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand how insurers assess risk."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Risk classification"},{"text":"Medical underwriting"},{"text":"Financial underwriting"},{"text":"Age-related risk"},{"text":"Occupation-related risk"},{"text":"Lifestyle-related risk"},{"text":"Policy exclusions"},{"text":"Loading"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Proposal forms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The advisor does not replace the insurer's underwriting function but should understand how underwriting affects policy terms."}]},{"heading":"Claims Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the general claims lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Incident","Intimation","Documentation","Assessment","Verification","Decision","Settlement/Repudiation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Claim intimation"},{"text":"Required documents"},{"text":"Claim forms"},{"text":"Hospital documents"},{"text":"Police reports where applicable"},{"text":"Surveyor/assessment concepts"},{"text":"Claim investigation"},{"text":"Settlement"},{"text":"Rejection/repudiation"},{"text":"Grievance escalation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A good advisor should help customers understand the process without making unsupported promises about claim approval."}]},{"heading":"Regulatory & Compliance Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IRDAI"},{"text":"Insurance intermediaries"},{"text":"Insurance agents"},{"text":"Brokers"},{"text":"Corporate agents"},{"text":"InsurTech platforms"},{"text":"Policyholder rights"},{"text":"Disclosure requirements"},{"text":"KYC"},{"text":"AML concepts"},{"text":"Mis-selling"},{"text":"Suitability"},{"text":"Customer grievance mechanisms"},{"text":"Data privacy"},{"text":"Record keeping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The advisor should avoid:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Misrepresentation"},{"text":"Concealing exclusions"},{"text":"False return projections"},{"text":"Guaranteed-return claims where not guaranteed"},{"text":"Forging customer information"},{"text":"Recommending unsuitable policies solely for commission"}]}]},{"heading":"Sales & Customer Relationship Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Insurance advisory is highly people-oriented."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Questioning"},{"text":"Product explanation"},{"text":"Simplifying financial terminology"},{"text":"Presentation skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sales"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lead generation"},{"text":"Prospect qualification"},{"text":"Need discovery"},{"text":"Product presentation"},{"text":"Objection handling"},{"text":"Follow-up"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Renewal management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Relationship Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Policy renewal reminders"},{"text":"Cross-selling where appropriate"},{"text":"Customer retention"},{"text":"Referral management"}]}]},{"heading":"Technology Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MS Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"CRM software"},{"text":"Email"},{"text":"Digital documentation"},{"text":"Video conferencing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL basics"},{"text":"Python basics"},{"text":"Data visualization"},{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Social media lead generation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital policy issuance"},{"text":"Online underwriting"},{"text":"e-KYC"},{"text":"Automated claims"},{"text":"Insurance comparison platforms"},{"text":"CRM systems"},{"text":"Customer portals"},{"text":"InsurTech"},{"text":"AI-based risk assessment"}]}]},{"heading":"Excel Skills for Insurance Advisors","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SUM"},{"text":"AVERAGE"},{"text":"IF"},{"text":"IFS"},{"text":"IFERROR"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"PivotTables"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Applications"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer database"},{"text":"Policy renewal tracker"},{"text":"Premium comparison sheet"},{"text":"Coverage-gap calculator"},{"text":"Lead conversion dashboard"},{"text":"Commission tracker"}]}]},{"heading":"Projects to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Insurance Needs Calculator"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an Excel-based calculator that estimates:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Income replacement requirement"},{"text":"Existing coverage"},{"text":"Outstanding liabilities"},{"text":"Number of dependents"},{"text":"Protection gap"},{"text":"Suggested coverage range"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Insurance Product Comparison Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare products using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Premium"},{"text":"Coverage"},{"text":"Policy term"},{"text":"Benefits"},{"text":"Exclusions"},{"text":"Waiting periods"},{"text":"Deductibles"},{"text":"Riders"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel + Power BI."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Insurance CRM"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simple customer management system containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer details"},{"text":"Policy details"},{"text":"Premium"},{"text":"Renewal date"},{"text":"Policy type"},{"text":"Lead status"},{"text":"Follow-up date"},{"text":"Claims status"}]}]},{"heading":"Advanced Capstone Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Digital Insurance Advisory & Customer Management Platform"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a system containing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer Profile","Needs Analysis","Protection Gap","Product Comparison","Recommendation Record","Policy Tracking","Renewal Alerts","Claims Tracking","Dashboard"]},{"type":"h","text":"Suggested Technology"},{"type":"note","label":"Frontend","text":"HTML/CSS/React"},{"type":"note","label":"Backend","text":"Python/Java"},{"type":"note","label":"Database","text":"MySQL/PostgreSQL"},{"type":"note","label":"Analytics","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"note","label":"Authentication","text":"Role-based access"},{"type":"note","label":"Deployment","text":"AWS/Azure"},{"type":"p","text":"For an undergraduate project, the platform should be presented as an educational/advisory-support system, not as a substitute for licensed professional advice or insurer underwriting."}]},{"heading":"Specialization Choices","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialization","Skills to Develop"],"rows":[[{"text":"Life Insurance Advisor"},{"text":"Life insurance, family protection, retirement planning"}],[{"text":"Health Insurance Advisor"},{"text":"Health products, claims, medical-policy concepts"}],[{"text":"General Insurance Advisor"},{"text":"Motor, property, travel and commercial insurance"}],[{"text":"Corporate Insurance Advisor"},{"text":"Business insurance, employee benefits, risk management"}],[{"text":"Insurance Sales"},{"text":"Lead generation, sales, negotiation, CRM"}],[{"text":"Bancassurance"},{"text":"Banking + insurance + relationship management"}],[{"text":"Insurance Operations"},{"text":"Policy administration, documentation, claims"}],[{"text":"Insurance Underwriting"},{"text":"Risk assessment, policy acceptance"}],[{"text":"Claims"},{"text":"Claims processing, documentation, investigation"}],[{"text":"InsurTech"},{"text":"Insurance + technology + analytics"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internship Roadmap","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target internships in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Insurance companies"},{"text":"Insurance brokers"},{"text":"Corporate agencies"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"Bancassurance teams"},{"text":"Insurance TPAs"},{"text":"InsurTech companies"},{"text":"Financial advisory firms"},{"text":"Claims departments"},{"text":"Underwriting teams"},{"text":"Insurance operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Insurance Sales Intern"},{"text":"Insurance Operations Intern"},{"text":"Claims Intern"},{"text":"Underwriting Intern"},{"text":"Bancassurance Intern"},{"text":"Customer Relationship Intern"},{"text":"Insurance Analytics Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Professional Qualifications","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"High-Value Professional Path"},{"type":"p","text":"IRDAI-related licensing/training requirements applicable to the intended insurance-agent/intermediary role should be completed before undertaking regulated solicitation activities."},{"type":"p","text":"Other useful qualifications depend on career direction:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Insurance-related NISM modules where relevant"},{"text":"Insurance Institute of India programs"},{"text":"Financial planning qualifications"},{"text":"Excel certification"},{"text":"Power BI certification"},{"text":"CRM certifications"},{"text":"Data analytics certifications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For an advisor, regulatory authorization + product knowledge + practical customer-handling ability is generally more important than collecting many unrelated certificates."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Com - Banking & Insurance:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Insurance Advisor"},{"text":"Insurance Agent"},{"text":"Insurance Sales Executive"},{"text":"Insurance Relationship Executive"},{"text":"Bancassurance Executive"},{"text":"Insurance Operations Executive"},{"text":"Claims Executive"},{"text":"Underwriting Assistant"},{"text":"Insurance Analyst"},{"text":"Customer Service Executive"},{"text":"Policy Administration Executive"},{"text":"Insurance Broker Executive"},{"text":"Financial Services Executive"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Academic Options"},{"type":"h","text":"M.Com"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Financial Management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Banking & Financial Services"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Risk Management"},{"text":"Financial Planning"},{"text":"Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialized Programs"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Insurance & Risk Management"},{"text":"Actuarial Science"},{"text":"Financial Planning"},{"text":"Banking & Financial Services"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Direction"},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term advancement, consider qualifications aligned with the intended role rather than automatically pursuing another degree."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's programs include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Insurance"},{"text":"MSc Risk Management"},{"text":"MSc Finance"},{"text":"MSc Financial Risk Management"},{"text":"MSc Actuarial Science"},{"text":"MSc Banking & Finance"},{"text":"MSc Financial Planning"},{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Germany"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Insurance-agent/advisor licensing, financial-advice authorization and product-selling permissions are jurisdiction-specific. An Indian insurance qualification does not automatically authorize insurance advisory activity in another country."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Insurance Advisory Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Banking & Insurance","Insurance Advisor / Insurance Sales Executive","Senior Insurance Advisor / Relationship Manager","Senior Relationship Manager","Branch/Agency Manager","Regional Sales Manager","Business Development / Distribution Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist Route"},{"type":"flow","items":["Insurance Advisor","Underwriting","Claims","Risk Management","Insurance Operations","Corporate Insurance","Insurance Analytics","InsurTech"]}]},{"heading":"Long-Term Relevance: 2030–2046","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Insurance advisory will increasingly combine human advisory skills with technology."},{"type":"p","text":"Important emerging areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted underwriting"},{"text":"Automated claims processing"},{"text":"Predictive risk analytics"},{"text":"Digital insurance distribution"},{"text":"Usage-based insurance"},{"text":"Personalized insurance"},{"text":"Embedded insurance"},{"text":"InsurTech"},{"text":"Fraud analytics"},{"text":"Customer behavior analytics"},{"text":"Automated renewal management"},{"text":"Digital health insurance ecosystems"},{"text":"Cyber insurance"},{"text":"Climate and catastrophe risk"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The advisor's role is likely to shift from product selling → protection planning + customer relationship + risk advisory + technology-enabled service."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Commerce"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Financial markets"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Life insurance"},{"text":"Health insurance"},{"text":"General insurance"},{"text":"Underwriting"},{"text":"Claims"},{"text":"Risk management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advisory"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial needs analysis"},{"text":"Protection-gap analysis"},{"text":"Financial planning fundamentals"},{"text":"Product comparison"},{"text":"Customer suitability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Sales"},{"text":"Customer relationship management"},{"text":"Ethics & compliance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"CRM"},{"text":"Digital documentation"},{"text":"Basic SQL/data analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IRDAI framework"},{"text":"KYC/AML awareness"},{"text":"Policyholder protection"},{"text":"Mis-selling prevention"},{"text":"Applicable licensing requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Portfolio Target"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong B.Com Banking & Insurance fundamentals"},{"text":"Knowledge of life, health and general insurance"},{"text":"Understanding of underwriting and claims"},{"text":"Insurance needs-analysis project"},{"text":"Product comparison dashboard"},{"text":"Insurance CRM project"},{"text":"Advanced Excel skills"},{"text":"Basic Power BI/data analytics"},{"text":"At least 1 relevant internship"},{"text":"Preparation for applicable insurance licensing/regulatory requirements"},{"text":"Strong customer communication and ethical sales skills"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Graduate Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Banking & Insurance","Accounting & Finance","Banking Fundamentals","Insurance Fundamentals","Life & Health Insurance","General Insurance","Risk Management","Underwriting & Claims","Financial Needs Analysis","Excel","CRM","Power BI","Regulatory Knowledge","Internship","Insurance Advisor","Senior Advisor / Relationship Manager","Insurance Specialist / Manager"]},{"type":"table","header":["ID","Level","Stream","Degree","Course / Specialisation","Career"],"rows":[[{"text":"1123"},{"text":"UG"},{"text":"Commerce"},{"text":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)"},{"text":"B.Com – Banking & Insurance"},{"text":"Underwriter (Junior)"}]]}]}]}